{"id": "lyric-hud-grant-reimbursement-and-rate", "title": "LYRIC’s federal audit found duplicate claims and charges before the grant began", "seconds": 54.2, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "064864770bbe8e63", "words": 157, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Auditors examined claims on a federal housing award to LYRIC.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.23, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Which", "costs", "could", "the", "grant", "cover?"], "sub": "Federal housing award"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.51, 0.99, 1.35, 1.47, 1.56, 1.9, 2.25, 2.58, 2.7]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "They found 54,799 dollars claimed twice.", "t0": 3.35, "t1": 7.21, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$54,799", "label": "Claimed twice on the same award"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.45, 1.03, 1.5, 1.82, 2.15, 2.69, 3.07, 3.4]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The organization proposed a reimbursement log and independent review of each draw.", "t0": 7.33, "t1": 11.21, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "Federal Audit Clearinghouse / independent auditor", "text": "Reimbursement log", "mark": "Reimbursement log"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.76, 1.14, 1.24, 1.9, 2.21, 2.35, 2.9, 3.21, 3.31, 3.5]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Another finding concerned 116,043 dollars in expenses incurred before the award period.", "t0": 11.33, "t1": 16.92, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$116,043", "label": "Costs incurred before the grant period"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.39, 0.78, 1.24, 1.4, 1.68, 2.15, 2.54, 3.04, 3.39, 3.5, 4.05, 4.43, 4.76, 4.89, 5.2]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The award period began on December 29, 2022.", "t0": 17.04, "t1": 20.44, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "Federal Audit Clearinghouse / independent auditor", "text": "December 29, 2022", "mark": "December 29, 2022"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.51, 0.86, 1.26, 1.37, 1.8, 2.51, 2.84]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The agreement elected a ten percent indirect rate. The organization charged fifteen percent.", "t0": 20.56, "t1": 25.55, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Indirect charges", "heading": "Two different rates", "source": "audit", "rows": [{"icon": "contract", "label": "Award election", "value": "10%"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Rate charged", "value": "15%"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.57, 0.97, 1.07, 1.31, 1.75, 2.28, 2.92, 3.12, 3.82, 4.15, 4.59]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The auditor calculated 48,814 dollars in indirect overbilling.", "t0": 25.67, "t1": 30.6, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$48,814", "label": "Indirect overcharge calculated by auditor"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.53, 1.18, 1.71, 2.15, 2.37, 2.67, 3.16, 3.58, 3.77, 4.34]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "LYRIC said it used the percentage in its original grant budget.", "t0": 30.72, "t1": 33.59, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "Federal Audit Clearinghouse / independent auditor", "text": "Original grant budget", "mark": "Original grant budget"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 0.55, 0.67, 0.87, 0.97, 1.5, 1.62, 1.78, 2.21, 2.48]}, {"scene": "scope", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The fiscal 2024 schedule reported 1,811,652 dollars for the direct federal grant.", "t0": 33.81, "t1": 38.88, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "Federal Audit Clearinghouse / independent auditor", "text": "FY2024 federal award schedule", "mark": "FY2024 federal award schedule"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.48, 0.78, 1.29, 1.72, 2.14, 2.45, 2.7, 2.95, 3.15, 3.49, 3.81, 3.95, 4.06, 4.37, 4.71]}, {"scene": "scope", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "San Francisco separately requested a contract with LYRIC for Health Access Point services.", "t0": 39.0, "t1": 43.57, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "city", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Public Health", "text": "Separate health services contract", "mark": "Separate health services contract"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.86, 1.33, 1.83, 1.92, 2.43, 2.63, 2.95, 3.11, 3.35, 3.72, 3.98]}, {"scene": "scope", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The questioned costs were on the direct federal housing grant.", "t0": 43.69, "t1": 46.45, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Direct federal award"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.56, 0.91, 1.08, 1.2, 1.33, 1.77, 2.12, 2.46]}, {"scene": "scope", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The records do not establish whether the costs overlap or how much was ultimately repaid.", "t0": 46.57, "t1": 51.09, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Costs", "Final repayment"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.54, 0.71, 0.9, 1.43, 1.72, 1.85, 2.2, 2.73, 2.88, 3.08, 3.33, 3.49, 3.96]}, {"scene": "scope", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 51.21, "t1": 53.33, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.63, 0.79, 1.03, 1.11, 1.21, 1.47, 1.75]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "Three findings on one federal grant", "scope": "What the findings cover"}, "look": "kinetic", "hook": "document"}